CeruleanCity_Text_RivalIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Still back here?\p"
    .string "I have bound strong ones. Clever\n"
    .string "ones. More than you, I expect.\p"
    .string "Show me what you have bound,\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "Enough. You won. You can stop.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RivalPostBattle::
    .string "{RIVAL}: I went to HOLT's.\p"
    .string "He showed me a DAEMON nobody else\n"
    .string "has.\p"
    .string "That is pages in my INDEX I did\n"
    .string "not have yesterday.\p"
    .string "HOLT is an ARCHIVIST. He built the\n"
    .string "storage system everybody uses.\p"
    .string "You use it too. Go and thank him.\n"
    .string "I did.\p"
    .string "I have things to do.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_OhRightLittlePresentAsFavor::
    .string "Oh, yeah, right.\p"
    .string "I feel sorry for you. No, really.\n"
    .string "You're always plodding behind me.\p"
    .string "So here, I'll give you a little\n"
    .string "present as a favor.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_ExplainFameCheckerSmellYa::
    .string "A chatty gossip like you…\n"
    .string "That thing's perfect.\p"
    .string "I don't need it because I don't\n"
    .string "give a hoot about others.\p"
    .string "All right, this time I really am\n"
    .string "gone. Smell ya!$"

@ RB translation: "Heh! You're no match for my genius!"
CeruleanCity_Text_RivalVictory::
    .string "なんたって！\n"
    .string "おれは　てんさい　だからよ！$"

CeruleanCity_Text_GruntIntro::
    .string "Hey! Stay out!\n"
    .string "It's not your yard!\p"
    .string "…Huh?\n"
    .string "Me?\p"
    .string "I'm an innocent bystander!\n"
    .string "Don't you believe me?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$"

CeruleanCity_Text_GruntDefeat::
    .string "GRUNT: Stop! I give up!\n"
    .string "I'll leave quietly!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_OkayIllReturnStolenTM::
    .string "…Okay. I'll return the PLUGIN I\n"
    .string "stole.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RecoveredTM28FromGrunt::
    .string "{PLAYER} recovered PLUGIN28 from\n"
    .string "the TEAM CORPUS GRUNT.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_BetterGetMovingBye::
    .string "I better get moving!\n"
    .string "Bye!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_MakeRoomForThisCantRun::
    .string "Make room for this!\n"
    .string "I can't run until I give it to you!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerLifeIsToughIsntIt::
    .string "You're a USER too? Collecting,\n"
    .string "engaging, it's a tough life.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_YouCanCutDownSmallTrees::
    .string "Did you know that you can PRUNE\n"
    .string "down small trees?\p"
    .string "Even that small tree in front of\n"
    .string "the shop goes down to PRUNE.\p"
    .string "I think there's a way around it,\n"
    .string "though.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_IfSlowbroWasntThereCouldCutTree::
    .string "If that SHELL wasn't there, you\n"
    .string "could PRUNE down the small tree.\p"
    .string "That way, you could get to the\n"
    .string "other side.\p"
    .string "I think there's a way around it,\n"
    .string "though.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_PokemonEncyclopediaAmusing::
    .string "You're making an encyclopedia on\n"
    .string "DAEMON? That sounds amusing.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_PeopleHereWereRobbed::
    .string "The people here were robbed.\p"
    .string "It's obvious that TEAM CORPUS is\n"
    .string "behind this most heinous crime!\p"
    .string "Even our POLICE force has trouble\n"
    .string "with CORPUS!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroUseSonicboom::
    .string "Okay! SHELL! Use CONSTANT!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroPayAttention::
    .string "Come on, SHELL, pay attention!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroPunch::
    .string "SHELL, punch!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_NoYouBlewItAgain::
    .string "No!\n"
    .string "You blew it again!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroWithdraw::
    .string "SHELL, EDDY!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_HardToControlMonsObedience::
    .string "SHELL, EDDY! No! That's wrong!\p"
    .string "It's so hard to control DAEMON!\p"
    .string "Your DAEMON's obedience depends on\n"
    .string "your abilities as a USER!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroTookSnooze::
    .string "SHELL took a snooze…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroLoafingAround::
    .string "SHELL is loafing around…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroTurnedAway::
    .string "SHELL turned away…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroIgnoredOrders::
    .string "SHELL ignored orders…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_WantBrightRedBicycle::
    .string "Everyone has the date wrong. Three\n"
    .string "days before that.\p"
    .string "Nobody in the room at all. It was\n"
    .string "a scheduled test.\p"
    .string "Against the outer wall. I am sure\n"
    .string "of that much.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_ThisIsCeruleanCave::
    .string "This is DOLDRUM CAVE! Horribly\n"
    .string "strong DAEMONS live in there!\p"
    .string "The DAEMON LEAGUE champion is the\n"
    .string "only person who is allowed in!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "DOLDRUM CITY\n"
    .string "A Mysterious,\l"
    .string "Blue Aura\l"
    .string "Surrounds It$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerTipsHeldItems::
    .string "USER TIPS\p"
    .string "A DAEMON can be made to hold an\n"
    .string "item.\p"
    .string "Some items can even be used by the\n"
    .string "holding DAEMON in battle.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_BikeShopSign::
    .string "Grass and caves handled easily!\n"
    .string "BIKE SHOP$"

CeruleanCity_Text_GymSign::
	.string "DOLDRUM CITY BENCHMARK\n"
	.string "LEADER: BASIN\p"
	.string "Keep Going Down And You Arrive$"

